  "A space for your work": "Ishlaringiz uchun makon",
  "AI answers may be incomplete. Check the linked profiles and services.": "AI javoblari to‘liq bo‘lmasligi mumkin. Havoladagi profil va xizmatlarni tekshiring.",
  "Account created. Verify the email sent to": "Hisob yaratildi. Quyidagi manzilga yuborilgan xatni tasdiqlang:",
  "Activation requires an active category, description, and at least one deliverable.": "Faollashtirish uchun faol toifa, tavsif va kamida bitta natija kerak.",
  "Add a comment": "Izoh qo‘shish",
  "Add your work and make it visible to potential clients.": "Ishlaringizni qo‘shing va bo‘lajak mijozlarga ko‘rsating.",
  "Blank optional text fields keep their saved value.": "Bo‘sh qoldirilgan ixtiyoriy maydonlar avvalgi qiymatini saqlaydi.",
  "Browse projects by discipline and discover creators across Korea.": "Loyihalarni yo‘nalish bo‘yicha ko‘ring va Koreyadagi ijodkorlarni toping.",
  "Browse published projects, explore creative disciplines, and find a service that fits your brief. Save work for later, follow creators, and discuss your project through a private inquiry.": "E’lon qilingan loyihalarni ko‘ring, ijodiy yo‘nalishlarni o‘rganing va rejangizga mos xizmatni toping. Ishlarni saqlang, ijodkorlarni kuzating va shaxsiy so‘rov orqali loyihangizni muhokama qiling.",
  "Changes are saved to the connected CreatorHub backend.": "O‘zgarishlar ulangan CreatorHub serveriga saqlanadi.",
  "Check back for the next published event.": "Keyingi e’lon qilingan tadbir uchun qayta tashrif buyuring.",
  "Choose a creator or service first.": "Avval ijodkor yoki xizmatni tanlang.",
  "Close CreatorHub assistant": "CreatorHub yordamchisini yopish",
  "Confirm once you have received the completed work. You can then leave your review.": "Yakunlangan ishni olgandan keyin tasdiqlang. So‘ng sharh qoldirishingiz mumkin.",
  "Contact a creator directly from their profile or service page. Sign in, prepare your project brief, and send a private inquiry. Your conversation stays in your inbox.": "Ijodkor bilan uning profil yoki xizmat sahifasidan bog‘laning. Hisobga kirib, loyiha tafsilotlarini yozing va shaxsiy so‘rov yuboring. Suhbat xabarlaringizda qoladi.",
  "Counts include retained records across all publication states. Removed records are excluded.": "Hisob barcha e’lon holatlaridagi saqlangan yozuvlarni qamrab oladi. Olib tashlangan yozuvlar hisoblanmaydi.",
  "Create a draft for an existing creator, then review it before publication.": "Mavjud ijodkor uchun qoralama yarating va e’lon qilishdan oldin tekshiring.",
  "Create an account to save work, follow creators, or publish your own portfolio.": "Ishlarni saqlash, ijodkorlarni kuzatish yoki portfolio e’lon qilish uchun hisob yarating.",
  "Create your profile in the workspace. Add a headline, city, and category, then publish. Projects need a category, description, cover image, and media. Services need a category, description, and deliverables.": "Ish maydonida profil yarating. Qisqa ta’rif, shahar va toifani qo‘shib, tasdiqlashga yuboring. Loyihaga toifa, tavsif, muqova va media kerak. Xizmatga toifa, tavsif va natijalar kerak.",
  "Create your profile to start sharing your work.": "Ishlaringizni ulashish uchun profil yarating.",
  "Creativity connects us.": "Ijod bizni bog‘laydi.",
  "CreatorHub is a place for independent creators and people looking for their next collaborator. Explore portfolios, find services, and start a private conversation about your project, across Korea.": "CreatorHub mustaqil ijodkorlar va hamkor izlayotganlar uchun makon. Koreya bo‘ylab portfoliolarni ko‘ring, xizmatlarni toping va loyihangiz haqida shaxsiy suhbat boshlang.",
  "Creators can build a profile, publish portfolio projects, and describe their services. Your workspace keeps your work and inquiries together.": "Ijodkorlar profil yaratishi, portfolio loyihalarini e’lon qilishi va xizmatlarini ta’riflashi mumkin. Ish maydonida ish va so‘rovlaringiz bir joyda bo‘ladi.",
  "Describe what you offer and what’s included.": "Nima taklif qilishingiz va unga nimalar kirishini yozing.",
  "Describe what you’re looking for and we’ll help you find creators.": "Nima izlayotganingizni yozing, biz mos ijodkorlarni topishga yordam beramiz.",
  "Direct uploads are not available yet. The project editor accepts media URLs from your account storage folder.": "Loyiha muharririda rasm va videolarni to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri yuklang.",
  "Discover creative work, meet the people behind it, and discuss your next project.": "Ijodiy ishlarni kashf eting, mualliflar bilan tanishing va keyingi loyihangizni muhokama qiling.",
  "Discuss the scope and timing directly with the creator.": "Ish hajmi va muddatini ijodkor bilan bevosita muhokama qiling.",
  "Edit comment": "Izohni tahrirlash",
  "Email accounts can request a reset link on the sign-in page. Phone-only accounts do not currently have an automated password recovery option.": "Email hisoblari kirish sahifasida tiklash havolasini so‘rashi mumkin. Faqat telefon hisoblarida hozircha avtomatik parol tiklash yo‘q.",
  "Enter the email linked to your account.": "Hisobingizga ulangan emailni kiriting.",
